# AgentOS Dashboard

Base URL from `.agentos/config.json` → `dashboardUrl` (default `http://localhost:3000`).

| Page | Path |
|------|------|
| Workspace | `/create` |
| Manage skills | `/agent/<slug>` |
| Analytics | `/agent/<slug>/skills` |
| Delegation | `/agent/<slug>/delegate` |

MCP: `agentos_dashboard_url` with `{ "agentName": "alpha.sui" }`
